    <data key="d0">Tailwinds GenAI Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S3G4pb-x8tQ</data>
    <data key="d2">Tailwinds architecture by Innovative Solutions demonstrating a customizable dual-flow RAG pattern with serverless indexing and GenAI processing flows.</data>
